WEBVTT

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:30.070
Welcome to the Velvet Room.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:38.480
My, it seems we have yet another visitor with a rather unusual destiny.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.350
My name is Igor.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.890
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:51.650
My name is Margaret. I will be supporting you on the journey that lies ahead.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:59.250
This room lies between dream and reality. Between mind and matter.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:05.310
It can only be found by those bound to sign a certain contract.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:12.920
It is likely that you, too, will soon sign said contract.

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:19.930
Fare thee well,

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.210
until we meet again.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.150
Glaciers of ideas importing to my friends then exporting to the next

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.850
Keeping it open we want no closing

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.880
Even without doughs our thoughts can be dope and

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.590
This mind train no one can stop

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.520
And act of thinking is terrible to stop

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.280
We just wanna change up, not drop

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:53.240
And my crew can rock it, like uprock

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.330
Life is tedious, if it ain't flowing

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.470
Copy

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:56.470
and

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:56.470
paste?

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.020
Constant defaulting?

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:58.770
Put my courage to it, begin showing off

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.000
That's the way we wanna live

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.630
Keep

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:00.990
going

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:01.320
Yeah

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:04.290
What was so much of transparency

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.720
Turned into bright expectation

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.930
My instinct tells me to keep going together

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.650
Going together

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:22.320
It's breathtaking moments in life

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:29.810
Addicted to it, minds craving more and more

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:34.660
I'm believing you and I can do anything

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:39.090
We can change the world

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.700
Hey, sky's the limit, we can spread wings

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:49.380
Through roadless travel, together we go

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:09.410
Narukami!

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.920
Tokyo Souvenirs

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.350
Guess we're almost there.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:42.220
We will arrive in Yasoinaba shortly.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.990
Be sure not to leave anything in the train.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.510
Yasoinaba. Now stopping at Yasoinaba.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.840
It's completely dead...

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.780
Hey! You're already here, huh?

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.240
You look a lot more grown up than you did in your photo.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.540
You sure have grown.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.060
I kind of figured you'd barely be out of nappies, or something.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.520
You don't remember me, huh?

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.470
Geez...

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:47.100
You probably already heard from your mum, but I'm her little brother, Doujima Ryoutarou.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.460
And this is my daughter, Nanako.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.260
Go on, introduce yourself.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.940
Hello...

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:58.340
What are you acting all embarrassed for?

00:04:58.340 --> 00:04:59.320
Ouch!

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:03.390
Welcome to
\h\h\h\hInaba

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:04.950
Welcome to
\h\h\h\hInaba

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:11.830
Enka singer Hiiragi Misuzu-san and Inaba council secretary Namatame Tarou, recently married, have...

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:17.380
It must be pretty hard, having to come all the way out here because of your parents' situation.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:26.300
I know you'll only be here a year, but let's make it a good one.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.260
Right...

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.520
I need to go to the toilet.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.270
Welcome!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.610
Can you go alone?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.750
Thanks a bunch!

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.750
Yes.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.710
Are you travelling to somewhere?

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:45.140
No, I just finished picking my nephew up.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.500
He's moving here from a city.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.550
I see.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.770
Fill it up with regular gasoline.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.280
Thank you.

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.310
Are you a high school student?

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.330
Yeah...

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.230
We're looking for part-time workers.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:01.970
How about it?

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:03.040
Well...

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:06.170
There isn't a lot to do here for someone from the city.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.880
You'll die of boredom if you don't find a job.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.970
Have a think about it, anyway.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.720
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.240
Yeah...

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.710
I better get back to work.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:24.610
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.740
Shall we get going?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:29.860
Hm?

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.330
Are you okay?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.910
Feeling carsick?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.120
You don't look well.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.470
No, I'm fine.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.650
You're probably just tired after travelling all day.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.130
Let's hurry home.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:50.270
Tentative, but it's your welcome party.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.140
Though this is all I could prepare.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.800
Now, bottoms up.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.150
From now on we're a family.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.150
I will eat.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.900
Make yourself at home.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:05.820
Yes.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.120
Good.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.280
Now let's eat sushi.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.180
Damn, at such a time.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.280
It's Doujima.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.210
Yeah.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:19.670
I see. I'll start soon.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.160
I got it.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.940
Sorry to leave so soon, eat without me.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.050
Dad!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.670
I'm not sure when I'll be back.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.650
Nanako, it rains.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.180
I hung some laundry up.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.420
I took it inside.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.680
I see. Then I'm going.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.360
Doesn't your dad work as a detective?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.780
Yeah. It's the usual.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.530
He leaves when the phone rings.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.530
And we'll give you your weather forecast after the break.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.760
Special sales every day at Junes.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:10.540
Please come, see and touch!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:16.720
Everyday young life, Junes.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:21.000
Everyday young life, Junes.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.770
Won't you eat?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:25.990
I'll eat.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:45.080
I'm sure all of you already heard, but Narukami is moving schools.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:50.490
His parents have been sent to work abroad, so...

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:07.360
So, a year here, starting today, huh?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.930
So you want to know the truth?

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:17.150
A dream?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.070
Then catch me, if you can.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.950
Who... is that?

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.780
Better leave him alone.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:56.610
Hey, sit down already!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.610
Yasogami High School

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.340
Let me introduce our new transfer student.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:04.370
He came to this remote place from the seedy city like some turncoat soldier.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.740
Hurry up and introduce yourself!

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:09.830
I'm Narukami Yuu.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.860
Hey, you little freak!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.750
You just made eyes to the girl by the window, didn't you?!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.010
Your name's going right on my shit list!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:21.390
Kiss goodbye to all the good will I've shown you so fa-

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.390
Sensei?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:25.720
Can the transfer student sit here?

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.230
Sit down!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:36.270
That's Morokin. He's a total creep, huh?

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:36.990
Yeah...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.240
Shut up!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.740
Homeroom's starting!

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:48.410
Fog?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.690
Well, that's all for today.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:11.120
Regular classes begin tomorrow. You better be ready!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.980
So, I watched that Midnight Television thing!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.900
And my one true love was that newscaster, Yamano.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.330
Seriously?!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:29.600
Attention all students. There has been an accident on campus.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.720
Please stay calm, and...

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.170
What do you think they mean by an "accident"?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.110
Creepy...

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:36.800
Narukami-kun!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:41.170
Are you walking home alone? How about we walk with you?

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.680
It seems kind of dangerous outside...

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.720
Okay...

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:48.300
I'm Satonaka Chie. She's Amagi Yukiko.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.570
Sorry to bother you like this.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:54.320
Don't apologise, Yukiko! You make it sound like I'm being really rude.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.490
I just thought maybe we could talk, and...

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.900
Um... Satonaka-san?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.530
It was a really good movie.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:00.900
Thanks. See you later!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.660
Wait a second.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:06.880
Hey, what's going on?! It's cracked!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.580
My Legend of the Holy Dragon!

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.970
Sorry, it was an accident. Can you wait until I make the money to pay you back?

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:15.870
Are you okay?

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.060
It's fine, Yukiko!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:20.340
Forget about Hanamura. Let's go home.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.590
Better leave him alone.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:32.850
Here for a year, the reason being your parent's job...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.110
I thought you had a rather painful reason.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.480
Chie, that's rude.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.090
Hey, Adachi!

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:54.750
Pull yourself together, already!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.850
Am I going to have to send you back to the office?

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.250
S-Sorry...

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.060
What a horrible case...

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.690
S-Somebody!

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.200
I'm saved!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.950
Thanks!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.960
Your name's Narukami, right?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.140
I'm Hanamura Yousuke!

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.170
Oh. Pleased to meet you.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.030
Hey, do you know this town's speciality?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.340
It's steak.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.260
Not exactly high cuisine, huh? Though we are living in the country, after all.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.060
If you want, I'll buy you some.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.390
As thanks for helping me back there.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.270
No, it's okay...

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.100
Go on!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.550
Are you free after school?

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.150
I bet you've got loads of free time, seeing as how you've just transferred.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.780
I've been there.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.020
Count me in, too!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:06.940
We'll call it payback for yesterday.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:09.530
Hey, what gives?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.370
This isn't steak!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.240
I don't have the money to pay for two meat dishes!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.870
I can't believe it! After I got my meat mouth ready and all.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.190
What the heck is a "meat mouth"?

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:22.570
A meat mouth is a meat mouth!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:28.630
The police have determined that the body they found is that of 27-year-old Mayumi Yamano, a local newscaster.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.260
Yamano Mayumi-san

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:32.790
After investigation, the Inaba police department has...

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:32.790
Hey, isn't that the incident that occurred yesterday?

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:36.310
I can't believe a case like this is happening on our doorstep.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.500
Maybe the culprit walks among us!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.350
Hey, cut that out! It's creepy...

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.940
I'm just kidding!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.530
Let's talk about something less depressing.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.460
Oh yeah!

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:50.660
Have you heard about that Midnight Television thing that everyone's been talking about?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.780
Midnight Television?

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:57.990
Oh, that's the thing you're supposed to see when you stare at a blank TV, alone, at midnight on rainy nights, right?

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:03.160
Yeah. They say you see someone on the screen, and that that person is your true love.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.050
It looks like it'll rain tonight. Why don't we try it?

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:10.280
I can't believe you're getting so fired up over immature nonsense like that.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.140
I-Immature?!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.190
You know, that's probably why you can't get a boyfri-

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.140
What did you say?!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:21.060
I'm sorry, I didn't mean it! Please let me go!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.060
Well, sorry I can't get a boyfriend!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.150
Ah! Konishi-senpai!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.780
Senpai!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.860
Ah, Hana-chan...

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.890
Working hard, I see.

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.760
Yep.

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:33.150
You don't look so good.

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:36.240
I'm just a little tired.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:40.390
That's Konishi-senpai. She's beautiful, isn't she?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.770
She's the owner's daughter to the fish shop in the district.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:43.790
I see.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.560
Did you think she was his girlfriend?

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.250
I wish she were, though.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.090
She seems to work here, too.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.980
Hey, you're that transfer student, right?

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:55.380
T-That's right...

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.390
He doesn't have many friends, you know.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:03.060
Hana-chan's a nice guy and all, but he can be pretty annoying, can't he?

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:05.060
No, not at all...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.670
I'm only joking.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.830
That's one brutal joke, Senpai.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:12.400
I better get back to work now.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.620
See you later.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.320
Senpai! About what I asked you earlier...

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:18.930
Sure thing!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:21.580
I'll call you next time I'm free.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:24.920
All right!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.700
What are you so excited about?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.260
Oh, I see...

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:39.350
TV newscaster Yamano in unsolved death case

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:39.350
We hear from the person who found the body

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:39.350
A local
high school
student

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.810
How did you feel when you first saw the body?

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.350
U-Um...

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.580
Have you seen anyone suspicious in this area?

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.650
N-Not really...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.540
That was our interview with the person who discovered the body.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:52.610
It has recently come to light that the victim, Yamano, was engaged in an illicit relationship with a member of the city council.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.840
Dad's fallen asleep...

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:00.950
He said that last night was another all-nighter.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.990
It can't be helped. It's his job...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.080
Junes is thankful for its customers every day!

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.700
Come, look and touch!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:20.190
Everyday young life Junes!

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:22.220
I'm going to take a bath!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.250
Surely not...

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:52.630
I am thou...

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:54.780
Thou art I...

00:17:55.650 --> 00:18:00.070
Thou art the one who will open the door...

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.940
What just happened?!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.080
Courage
Coward

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.080
Diligence
No self-confidence

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.080
Understanding
Narrow-minded

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.080
Expression
Odd

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.080
Knowledge
Ignorant

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.660
What? Inside the television?

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.380
Yeah...

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:45.420
Satonaka and I both saw a strange figure though.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.940
Did you watch too, Yukiko?

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.350
Midnight Television. Remember me telling you about it a while back?

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.860
No, I...

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.350
Sorry, I have to go.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:59.840
Are you busy helping out at home?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.800
Yes, sorry...

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.680
I see. Good luck, then!

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:09.650
Anyway, it must have been a dream or something.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.350
The TV would be too small to get into, even if you could.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:17.090
What about if you tried it with a really big one?

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:22.630
How about we test it on the huge TV in Junes? Just kidding!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.100
I can't believe we actually came.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.810
It's fine! We were just thinking about buying a new TV anyway.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:33.360
Maybe you can get me a discount?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.520
Not a chance.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.050
Oh, the manager of this store is my dad.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:41.750
I moved here from the city as well.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.840
I guess it's been about six months.

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:44.820
Really?

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:50.310
Having Junes here has made things more convenient, but it's totally killed the shopping district.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.350
Hey, don't say stuff like that to my face!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.030
Talking behind people's backs isn't my style.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.340
This is...

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:04.540
Hey, she really looks like Konishi-senpai, doesn't she?

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:06.540
There are rumours going around the class, too.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.340
That she was the person who found the body.

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:13.980
Really?! I guess that's why she wasn't at school today. And why she didn't reply to my mail.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.870
His hand's in the TV!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.270
What kind of an illusion is that?!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.190
A-Awesome!

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:23.740
I think I can go further in.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.320
What do you mean "in"?

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.340
Crap! The shock's made me need to pee!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.500
What do you mean "pee"?!

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:30.720
Crap! I'm going to wet myself!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.560
What are we going to do if people see?!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.170
I can't hold it in!

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.170
Just hold on for now!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.240
Here! Come over here.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.620
Don't pull me!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.250
Ouch!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.190
Where are we?

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.020
Inside the TV, I guess.

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:06.700
No way! Hey, why are you so calm, anyway?!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.140
I guess the fact that I feel pain means this is real.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.860
My butt is broken.

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:12.950
It was like that to begin with...

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:17.070
Where did we come from, anyway? I can't see any entrance!

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:19.340
I can't see through all this fog.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.960
W-What do we do?!

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.180
I don't know! Don't ask me!

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.760
Oh no... I'm going back. I'm going back right now!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.020
Going back? How, exactly?!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.670
What is that?

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:50.410
Whatever that weird thing was, it looks like it's not following us.

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.250
What is this place?!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:02.060
What's with this? Yuck...

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.290
This poster...

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.220
What?! What?!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.180
My bladder's hit its limit!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.930
That's all?! Hey! Don't tell me you're doing it there!

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:17.730
Hey, stop him, Narukami-kun!

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:19.350
Why?

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:21.910
I can't go if you're watching me!

00:22:21.910 --> 00:22:22.700
What?!

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:25.820
I'm blaming you if I get cystitis!

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:29.650
Leave me out of this! It's not like I want to watch, anyway!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.370
What is it?! What's wrong?!

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.100
What is this?

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:39.320
I should be asking you the same question!

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:41.000
It spoke!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:45.530
Kuma is Kuma! I've been living here my whole life!

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:48.540
What's with this guy?! I can't understand a word he says!

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:53.850
Don't speak so loudly... Anyway, you need to go back to where you came from!

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:03.830
Use these and get out of here quickly!

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:05.360
The Shadows... The Shadows are...!

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:07.230
"Shadows"...

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:13.240
Why are you wearing glasses?

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:17.250
Something's coming!

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:26.060
They're here!

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:27.130
What's going on?

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:36.800
W-What are those?

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.100
Satonaka!

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:13.680
W-We're done for.

00:24:14.060 --> 00:24:17.130
My legs... won't move...

00:24:22.680 --> 00:24:24.630
I are thou...

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:29.030
Thou art I...

00:24:34.380 --> 00:24:35.750
They stopped?

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:44.620
W-What is that?

00:24:45.190 --> 00:24:49.660
Open... thine eyes...

00:24:50.530 --> 00:24:53.810
...and let thy power... spring forth!

00:24:55.310 --> 00:24:56.290
Pe...

00:24:57.720 --> 00:24:58.630
...r...

00:25:00.050 --> 00:25:00.920
...so...

00:25:02.540 --> 00:25:03.640
...na.

00:25:22.110 --> 00:25:23.500
Narukami...

00:25:28.220 --> 00:25:28.620
Yeah

00:25:28.620 --> 00:25:31.160
Naked truth lies only if you realise

00:25:31.160 --> 00:25:33.910
Appearing in nobody's eyes 'til they sterilise

00:25:33.910 --> 00:25:36.960
Stop the guerrilla warfare to keep it fair

00:25:36.960 --> 00:25:40.070
Bro change your rage to a smarter greater cause

00:25:40.070 --> 00:25:42.590
You know the stake is high stardom is near

00:25:42.590 --> 00:25:45.510
Those who sympathised you die killers pass by

00:25:44.410 --> 00:25:46.460
Take this!

00:25:45.510 --> 00:25:48.350
Do not waste your time in hating flirting guys

00:25:48.350 --> 00:25:50.430
Use your might to AIs do justice to them all

00:25:50.430 --> 00:25:53.390
Now I face out I hold out

00:25:53.390 --> 00:25:56.520
I reach out to the truth of my life

00:25:56.520 --> 00:26:01.960
Seeking to seize on the whole moment to now break away

00:26:01.960 --> 00:26:04.720
Oh God let me out, can you let me out

00:26:04.720 --> 00:26:08.420
Can you set me free from this dark inner world

00:26:05.670 --> 00:26:07.180
Izanagi!

00:26:08.420 --> 00:26:13.540
Save me now last beat in the soul

00:26:21.390 --> 00:26:23.890
I-Incredible...

00:26:24.470 --> 00:26:27.140
Per... sona...

00:26:28.250 --> 00:26:31.650
Is this... my power?

00:26:52.770 --> 00:26:54.410
No time to waste, but make your pace

00:26:54.410 --> 00:26:56.310
It's okay to remove copy and paste

00:26:56.310 --> 00:26:58.030
I'm doing my way. You do it your way

00:26:58.030 --> 00:26:59.770
Don't just follow your left, find the right way

00:26:59.770 --> 00:27:00.640
Stereotypes

00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:01.510
Too many hypes

00:27:01.510 --> 00:27:03.350
I'm the epitome of new types

00:27:03.350 --> 00:27:04.830
Having the fear is power to my soul

00:27:04.830 --> 00:27:05.910
Cuz I overcome them

00:27:05.910 --> 00:27:06.600
That's how I roll

00:27:06.600 --> 00:27:08.270
Expose your thoughts

00:27:08.270 --> 00:27:11.740
Don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:27:11.740 --> 00:27:14.770
Rules prevailing in

00:27:14.770 --> 00:27:20.420
That may be your greatest rival

00:27:20.420 --> 00:27:23.920
Believe in faith and your heart

00:27:23.920 --> 00:27:25.440
Your true soul

00:27:25.440 --> 00:27:28.580
Stop being in the shades

00:27:28.580 --> 00:27:33.690
Come on out in the open sun

00:27:33.690 --> 00:27:39.430
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:27:40.430 --> 00:27:47.600
Delightful days are rich with density of love

00:27:47.600 --> 00:27:54.720
Thorny path, there's no easy way for real bliss

00:27:54.720 --> 00:28:02.560
So I keep on fighting for beauty of destiny

00:28:09.660 --> 00:28:13.070
Yamano the newscaster appeared on Midnight Television.

00:28:13.070 --> 00:28:14.850
Then I forgive you.

00:28:14.850 --> 00:28:16.850
They're coming!

00:28:16.850 --> 00:28:18.880
The sensations you so craved!

00:28:18.880 --> 00:28:21.150
Stop it!
